# Prettier is adopted here for the assets this plugin ships into the dashboard,
# and for nothing else yet. Everything is ignored and the page assets are added
# back a level at a time, because an ignore file cannot re-include a file whose
# parent directory is still ignored.
#
# Widening this to the workflows, the documents or the manifest is a separate
# change: those files are written by other issues in this plan and reformatting
# them here would bury real edits under whitespace.
/*
!/Jellyfin.Plugin.Stats
/Jellyfin.Plugin.Stats/*
!/Jellyfin.Plugin.Stats/Configuration
/Jellyfin.Plugin.Stats/Configuration/*
!/Jellyfin.Plugin.Stats/Configuration/*.html
!/Jellyfin.Plugin.Stats/Configuration/*.css
!/Jellyfin.Plugin.Stats/Configuration/*.js
